      "LIDDY: I CAN’T LOOK!\nBATHSHEBA: Liddy! Perhaps you should do it.",
      "LIDDY: Do you want me any longer ma’am?\nBATHSHEBA: No more tonight, Liddy.\nLIDDY: I’ll wait up if you like.\nBATHSHEBA: No, you go to bed. Do you know what she died of, Liddy?",
      "BATHSHEBA: Liddy, that’s enough.\nLIDDY: Sorry, Miss."
    ]
